# /etc/git-plus-runner/runner.env  (root:root, mode 0644; read by odytor-runner, never by a shell)
# ODYTOR_RUNNER_* is canonical; the older ODYTOR_RUNNER_* spelling is still read during the transition.
# Pin the image by digest. Load it first: podman pull docker.io/library/python@sha256:...
ODYTOR_RUNNER_IMAGE=docker.io/library/python@sha256:REPLACE_WITH_DIGEST
# ODYTOR_RUNNER_CPUS=2
# ODYTOR_RUNNER_MEMORY_MIB=4096
# ODYTOR_RUNNER_PIDS=512
# ODYTOR_RUNNER_ENV_TTL_DAYS=7
# ODYTOR_RUNNER_ENV_BUDGET_MIB=10240
# ODYTOR_RUNNER_MIN_FREE_MIB=2048
# ODYTOR_RUNNER_PIP_INDEX_URL=https://pypi.org/simple
